## Generators

{% card title="The first card" id="first" kind="Generator" %}
The stage `first` · the talk's demo `c01`

{% part title="The rule" %}
A tile becomes wall when five of its neighbors are {% ref source="talk" t="06:10-06:59" /%}.

1. Count the walls around a tile {% ref source="code" path="src/main.rs" lines="43" /%}{% ref source="code" path="src/main.rs" lines="40-54" /%}{% ref source="talk" t="06:10-06:59" /%}.
2. Five or more make it wall {% ref source="talk" t="06:10-06:59" /%}.
{% /part %}

